WEBVTT

00:00:27.674 --> 00:00:32.200
because we have with us
just an extraordinary author,

00:00:32.224 --> 00:00:35.398
an extraordinary mind,

00:00:35.422 --> 00:00:37.466
Elizabeth Gilbert,

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:41.277
obviously known for her astonishing
best-selling success

00:00:41.301 --> 00:00:43.587
with "Eat, Pray, Love,"

00:00:43.611 --> 00:00:47.780
although her favorite book
from my point of view

00:00:47.804 --> 00:00:49.906
is called "Big Magic,"

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:53.351
where the subtitle is,
"Creative Living Beyond Fear."

00:00:54.122 --> 00:00:55.588
"Creative Living Beyond Fear."

00:00:55.612 --> 00:00:56.956
Now when you think about it,

00:00:56.980 --> 00:01:02.762
that is a pretty good agenda
for today's conversation, I think.